{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7a3ad19154f0a4313989971665591602264ae7cb98ee06612cd28cbc5f586d61", "ja": "隠れた本音", "zh": "隐藏的心声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cbd6fe40b2ef0957b6772213e8c6269725b5e77e7c0958e77c2fcd312fdea735", "ja": "未来の体調を考慮し、対決のペースを落とす\nことになった。未来に勝負にこだわる理由を\n聞いてみると、それは相手を知るためだと\nいう。未来の本音を知った千鶴は、未来との\n対決を快く引き受ける。", "zh": "考虑到未来的身体状况，决定放慢对决的节奏。\n问起未来执着于较量的理由，她说这是为了了解对手。\n得知未来的真心后，千鹤欣然接受了与未来的对决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "14cae5f6b2f36e37a75e88fa067092f6d95dda9cbfef7213e793fb0ae087d76b", "ja": "（念の為病院で精密検査をしてもらった結果、\n未来はやっぱり過労気味とのことだった）", "zh": "（为了保险起见，去医院做了详细检查，结果果然是过度劳累。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "83674218ac0acaf9bb98e770f31ffa2a21f9dcf62191dd7ba444796c8560e3a9", "ja": "現状大したことはないらしいけど、\nこの調子で行くと危なかったみたいだ。", "zh": "听说目前没什么大碍，不过照这样下去的话，似乎就危险了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "203c697dec8fd391a387b916988b33f3a020e2c11854417182c425bccc124da3", "ja": "少し休日を挟もう。劇場のみんなの対決も、\n今より少しペースを落とすこと。いいな？", "zh": "先稍微放几天假吧。剧场大家的对决，\n节奏也要比现在稍微放慢一点。明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "3395ac5e7baae56dab66b059d047306cc89f42be18e8f569be132b6bd97d4ca6", "ja": "うう……。\nもっともっと対決やりたかったのになぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜……  \n明明还想再多比几场的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "32e872d525bb06d9dfb05a25c0a7a78d207591afb96f10e67113c5f1c96839ab", "ja": "無理は禁物ですわ。\n公演の前に体を壊しては元も子もありませんもの。", "zh": "千万别勉强自己。\n要是在公演前把身体弄坏了，可就得不偿失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "59e0c4d9857771e02884092da4649a5cfe45edb89743c27e4d23341e5cd400b3", "ja": "それは、はい……。", "zh": "这个嘛，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d102b45b05895a319d87a9a111f8457dcc5708ed886df5dff3469be9d11a2a82", "ja": "……。\n未来、ひとつ聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "……。\n未来，我能问你一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "17c7161aadc6c9ec8a4d203961b7ae9a45bbdcf6f128e3f536ee5609b03683d5", "ja": "？　はい。", "zh": "？好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "693a8ce0cc8cad41c5acc52d2c2d23afd4f683d0baff10529fd6057eb06edebd", "ja": "未来は、どうしてそんなに対決がしたいんだ？\nもともと勝負事が好きという訳でもないのに。", "zh": "未来，你为什么那么想要对决？\n明明你本来就不是喜欢争强好胜的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3aac462d05dd221cf42939ac1a88e1e569264815f46d249dcc6797d3291e8ba3", "ja": "最初からずっとだよな。BOTが終わるのが嫌だって、\nみんなを巻き込んで対決を仕掛けたりして……。", "zh": "从一开始就一直这样。说不想让BOT结束，\n拉着大家搞什么对决……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aa63eb6287d7fe17a9271987663610f124581e473081ef132cf098826715f26e", "ja": "気が済むまでと思ってたけど、勢いは増すばかりだし。\nそこまで対決に熱が入ってるのは、どうしてなんだ？", "zh": "我本来想着等你尽兴就好，可势头却越来越猛。你为什么会对这种对决如此投入呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "76eba6bf603bc2ec5f9456908e43f5ed9aad02827d2cf5e1ac380b592f79c0a0", "ja": "えっと、それは……\nみんなのことが、もっとわかるからです！", "zh": "那个，这是因为……\n这样就能更加了解大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "b5b629561a5526571ff98468fe3068ee014991d61f60e7003cf4cfe03a7fe381", "ja": "みんなのことが、もっとわかる……とは？", "zh": "“更了解大家”……是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "faac9e6beadb7acb61d5217df01456d04c4e59a6938d0594ac246911461eaafd", "ja": "BOT、最初は劇場のみんなで戦う公演って\n聞いて、どうすればいいのかわかりませんでした。", "zh": "BOT，最开始听说是一场剧场大家互相战斗的公演，\n我完全不知道该怎么办才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "a81b65abcb1b11200166a3e1a6585a6bfc4dfced9cdd3ef8b7524dd12788e8ed", "ja": "だって……それでギスギスするのは、嫌だなって。\nみんなのこと大好きだから……。", "zh": "因为……我不想因为那样让大家之间变得剑拔弩张。\n因为我最喜欢大家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "c1e962c00dafcd963504c20ed36aecbb62197a713c572fd02f22dfd6c07b7d58", "ja": "でも、本気で真剣に競い合ってるみんなを見てたら、\n見たことのない顔だーって思って！", "zh": "可是，看到大家都在认真地全力竞争，我就觉得——这还是第一次看到大家露出这样的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "98abe6144986441496752fbe716b47243b55bd466092f4b5ec8e0fedaef9fe5e", "ja": "見たことのない顔……。", "zh": "从没见过的表情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "10349213307384a9486ef17ce12e19171f8d94b8b13bdbed1a22f611d70ec1cc", "ja": "みんなのことは、もう何でも知ってるって\n思ってたのに。全然違うみんなが見れたんです！", "zh": "我还以为自己已经什么都了解大家了。没想到却看到了完全不同的大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "3b9d7680ab32c6d4c4135b7601f9a41ea5055eebc6d4103c78c2457c07770e74", "ja": "見たことないみんなが見れて、それで、\nもっともっと見てみたいってなって……！", "zh": "看到了从没见过的大家，然后，就想要看更多更多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "c8c33628433deba57a7507a5a337e283d9affc4996943f240c9ca503566d3799", "ja": "……未来の勝負へのこだわりは、\n勝負そのものではなかったんですのね。", "zh": "……原来，您执着于和未来一决胜负，并不是因为比赛本身啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "032cd8534dc2ae8d913780314b9f3c569564ac89b395eb32734240a825571d3d", "ja": "はい！　私、みんなのこと、\nまだまだ全然知らないんだーって！", "zh": "是的！我才发现，自己还一点都不了解大家呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "f4f56d34ab702b07b8fa274b1692ac29304a666184f8f5f86bd055b3422ffcd8", "ja": "なのに、もう終わりなんてやだよーって！\nそういう意味です！", "zh": "明明这样，我才不要就这么结束啊——！\n就是这个意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "f36abda1c9c5ea5f0ec4568dff7e24851cd3286c074307a285a8f43afc9ecb7a", "ja": "ではつまり、\nわたくしと戦いたい、というのも……？", "zh": "那么，也就是说，\n您想和我战斗，也是因为……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "c24e1dfdf495cc5c2c4d51c6ddf9ef8538fd1fac3cfa1ae56fc6acdc3e63c78c", "ja": "はい！　千鶴さんのいろんな顔、\n絶対見たいからです！", "zh": "是的！因为我绝对想看到千鹤小姐各种各样的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "0995e106f6dd06d17c8c88a750bae5fd03fc810a5aa7960c751e02030c9025cd", "ja": "わたくしの、いろんな顔……。\nそうでしたのね……。", "zh": "我的各种样子……原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "b608601e88442a6a3ab864242f67e7b42db873b60af01d0d40d313adde7b2cd7", "ja": "わかりました。\n未来の気持ち、しかと受け止めましたわ。", "zh": "我明白了。\n未来的心意，我确实感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "b087204fbb6c53d9b57e662978e19a84261930b2eea93fc9c8c879827432c0fb", "ja": "この二階堂千鶴……\n『ズバリとセレブ！』対決、受けて立ちます！", "zh": "我，二阶堂千鹤……就来迎战这场『一针见血的名媛！』对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "98f22afb58dfad5fc1fe06e3ace0c0dd2d2a1c6f90ad03b4aa146bd9a3fa745d", "ja": "えっ！？\nいいんですかっ！？", "zh": "诶！？\n真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b587c064bdbb8d5033b29b84ef4f4e016c07352b240c3fab07c999a506629058", "ja": "千鶴さん、いいんですか？", "zh": "千鹤，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "96c53a56314219c2d6f42c7a1275845adf91003069c6db8893ef0c8fd2cccfe9", "ja": "ええ。こうもまっすぐ、わたくし自身を\n望まれているんですもの。", "zh": "嗯。既然对方如此坦率地希望得到真正的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "b92f3cc6b03e2802e8baa3bad2ca9ca1a52abec857da95bb3aaf99c8bef2ad04", "ja": "それに……わたくしも決めましたもの。\n決して理想を投げ出さず戦っていくと。", "zh": "而且……我也已经下定决心了。\n绝不放弃理想，继续战斗下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "abab68b8659b3dd828aebf94ddb01c7fa8dd918282c0a2144417883faa49f57d", "ja": "{$P$}が、\nそのことを一番わかっているのではなくて？", "zh": "{$P$}不是最明白这一点的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "57d54410f2ea8e1581615eb34ccf0f37484cf0c4dbb09f2c38fb889474b6eda8", "ja": "千鶴さん……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "1f8b18fa7ef6e7d67fa80dcbd65599becf350b5d00c8f00ee89834a834426351", "ja": "未来、勝負は必ずしますわ。\nだから今は、しっかり体を休ませること。", "zh": "未来，我们一定会决一胜负的。\n所以现在，先好好休息，养精蓄锐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "21ec75c1d8f5f2a1ee06a0d9af5fc34e382a6653bbdc3dbe100fe6ce57bb4cc4", "ja": "わたくしの本気が見たいなら、\n未来も体調を整えて本気を見せてご覧なさい。", "zh": "要是想见识我的真本事，\n未来你也得调理好身体，拿出真本事来给我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "8109da1ecdd77866a36c4cb4171a36abbebe8bd3c697075b9452b2950a7be985", "ja": "！　はいっ！\n約束です！", "zh": "！　好！\n这是约定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fee79622e5d424cc972ffffa37b3ecf238d040916255fe6de39b58b541d690a2", "ja": "（未来の意図と千鶴さんの覚悟、\nそれぞれがはっきり見える）", "zh": "（未来的意图和千鹤的觉悟，都清晰可见）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "1a923613f77e7172e3947bcef7f6448b4e60660617c1ceff3e15102f9b4d7c6c", "ja": "（それと同時に、公演の骨子みたいなものが……。\n2人の勝負、目を離すわけにはいかないな！）", "zh": "（与此同时，公演的骨架之类的东西也……。这场2人的对决，我可不能移开视线啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
